{"publicId":"1f7f704b-a295-4b14-9e6b-c479711e341a","title":"Immunocore公布brenetafusp联合Kimmtrak治疗眼黑色素瘤早期数据","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T17:00:22.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-06T17:00:22.000Z","digest":"Immunocore宣布，约70%的uveal melanoma（眼葡萄膜黑色素瘤）患者在联合使用brenetafusp（PD-1抑制剂）和Kimmtrak（抗CTLA-4单抗）后出现积极应答【新】。brenetafusp通过阻断PD-1与肿瘤抗原的相互作用增强抗肿瘤免疫，而Kimmtrak则抑制CTLA-4介导的免疫抑制信号。该试验针对不可切除的晚期uveal melanoma患者，当前数据基于尚未公布完整结果的早期试验（样本量未披露，未定义终点）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T13:07:06.078Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Immunocore 报告 brenetafusp 与 Kimmtrak 联合治疗 uveal 熊果瘤的初步数据","latestReport":{"id":"snidg9io9d2676rgx8sn6ifyb"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fIIjz3P4Cy5g","title":"Immunocore 报告了 brenetafusp 加 Kimmtrak 在 uveal melanoma 中的早期数","firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T17:00:22.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"snidg9io9d2676rgx8sn6ifyb","title":"Immunocore 报告 brenetafusp 与 Kimmtrak 联合治疗 uveal 熊果瘤的初步数据","summary":"Immunocore 报告，约 70% 的 uveal 熊果瘤患者在联合使用 brenetafusp 与 Kimmtrak 后表现出积极反应。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T17:00:22.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"snidg9io9d2676rgx8sn6ifyb","title":"Immunocore 报告 brenetafusp 与 Kimmtrak 联合治疗 uveal 熊果瘤的初步数据","summary":"Immunocore 报告，约 70% 的 uveal 熊果瘤患者在联合使用 brenetafusp 与 Kimmtrak 后表现出积极反应。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T17:00:22.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T14:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour